    "detailed_description": "<h1>Patch Notes: March 30</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another patch with lots of requested features! I've been hard at work the past few weeks implementing some of the most highly requested features like Cloud Saves and Windowed Mode, and now those features are here! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the changes today, just like the last patch, are for Windows only. The Mac version of these changes are still a work in progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added cloud saves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added windowed support, window resizing, and fullscreen toggling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed some typos and added some flavor text and overworld objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added a dozen Easter Eggs referencing other videogames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added a barrier in the church to move one Spell later and make it have more utility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changed the plant names in the museum to not contain duplicates. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added an ingame prize for beating the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gave more utility to a postgame Spell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added a feature that tells you what Spells you didn't encounter after you beat the game, in case you have missed any.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added more catharsis in the ending cutscene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed picking up a flower when you had 0 of that flower always generating the New Flower text. (It will still happen once on your save file before it fixes itself.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changed the Sakuya's vase achievement to require not having the final flower (which it used to always require before the last patch.)</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/7059d3f6c57a4a07f192867e82578acd.poster.avif?t=1743371598\" width=634 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/7059d3f6c57a4a07f192867e82578acd.webm?t=1743371598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/7059d3f6c57a4a07f192867e82578acd.mp4?t=1743371598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Flowereverie is a peaceful flower-laden puzzle game where, to perform any action you must first spell it, by arranging letters like flowers in a vase. Hone your flower-arranging skills to spell anything you can think of! Learn to walk, talk, climb, swim, and more, by collecting flowers and vases to create beautiful arrangements of letters. Cast spells, spell spells, become the land's most prolific flower arranger, and you might be able to discover the dark secrets of the town proper.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/96d2fcafd61939ef3ec75a68de90938b.poster.avif?t=1743371598\" width=634 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/96d2fcafd61939ef3ec75a68de90938b.webm?t=1743371598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/96d2fcafd61939ef3ec75a68de90938b.mp4?t=1743371598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In the world governed by the mythical and loved-by-all goddess Sakuya, no action can be undertaken before first spelling it by arranging letters in a vase like flowers. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/d970394396cf722ac26d75a831bd5165.poster.avif?t=1743371598\" width=640 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/d970394396cf722ac26d75a831bd5165.webm?t=1743371598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/d970394396cf722ac26d75a831bd5165.mp4?t=1743371598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>When passers-by enter the peaceful and idyllic world, they cannot even walk or talk, but after learning to &quot;arrange&quot; those words using flowers and vases, the artform of flower-arranging reveals itself as a rich and infinitely deep concentration.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/b4e26d293767c47992017a9224a89c43.avif?t=1743371598\" width=608 height=158 /></span><br><br>By changing just 1 letter of the Red Pedalwalker, the very first flower you encounter in the game, you can spell TALK, LIE, and ALTER! It's a very powerful flower indeed. As you learn more Spells, you'll be able to change more letters in more ways, and spell even longer and more complicated Spells.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/20b551e9f7762ab268fe97b055f66ce5.avif?t=1743371598\" width=640 height=212 /></span><br><br>Outsiders to the peaceful village home to the flower-arranging art have trouble grasping the village's strange way of life, and thus are a rarity. As you become more well-versed in the culture of the world, dark secrets of the town proper will start to reveal themselves.<br><br>What is the truth of this flower-laden world? What are its secrets? Become the best flower-arranger in the land, expose the world's lies, and decide the future of the world of Flowereverie.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/7059d3f6c57a4a07f192867e82578acd.poster.avif?t=1743371598\" width=634 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/7059d3f6c57a4a07f192867e82578acd.webm?t=1743371598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/7059d3f6c57a4a07f192867e82578acd.mp4?t=1743371598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Flowereverie is a peaceful flower-laden puzzle game where, to perform any action you must first spell it, by arranging letters like flowers in a vase. Hone your flower-arranging skills to spell anything you can think of! Learn to walk, talk, climb, swim, and more, by collecting flowers and vases to create beautiful arrangements of letters. Cast spells, spell spells, become the land's most prolific flower arranger, and you might be able to discover the dark secrets of the town proper.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/96d2fcafd61939ef3ec75a68de90938b.poster.avif?t=1743371598\" width=634 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/96d2fcafd61939ef3ec75a68de90938b.webm?t=1743371598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/96d2fcafd61939ef3ec75a68de90938b.mp4?t=1743371598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In the world governed by the mythical and loved-by-all goddess Sakuya, no action can be undertaken before first spelling it by arranging letters in a vase like flowers. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/d970394396cf722ac26d75a831bd5165.poster.avif?t=1743371598\" width=640 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/d970394396cf722ac26d75a831bd5165.webm?t=1743371598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/d970394396cf722ac26d75a831bd5165.mp4?t=1743371598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>When passers-by enter the peaceful and idyllic world, they cannot even walk or talk, but after learning to &quot;arrange&quot; those words using flowers and vases, the artform of flower-arranging reveals itself as a rich and infinitely deep concentration.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/b4e26d293767c47992017a9224a89c43.avif?t=1743371598\" width=608 height=158 /></span><br><br>By changing just 1 letter of the Red Pedalwalker, the very first flower you encounter in the game, you can spell TALK, LIE, and ALTER! It's a very powerful flower indeed. As you learn more Spells, you'll be able to change more letters in more ways, and spell even longer and more complicated Spells.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672070/extras/20b551e9f7762ab268fe97b055f66ce5.avif?t=1743371598\" width=640 height=212 /></span><br><br>Outsiders to the peaceful village home to the flower-arranging art have trouble grasping the village's strange way of life, and thus are a rarity. As you become more well-versed in the culture of the world, dark secrets of the town proper will start to reveal themselves.<br><br>What is the truth of this flower-laden world? What are its secrets? Become the best flower-arranger in the land, expose the world's lies, and decide the future of the world of Flowereverie.",
